WEBVTT

00:00:00.363 --> 00:00:10.803
Switching projects used to mean opening the project menu and scanning its list. Now Command P, or Control P on Windows and Linux, opens a quick switcher over the page.

00:00:11.757 --> 00:00:19.957
Every project is there. One with cards waiting for you shows their count, and the project open now sits at the bottom, since you came here to leave it.

00:00:21.713 --> 00:00:28.633
Typing narrows the list: a name, a word in it, or just its letters in order. Enter goes straight to the project.

00:00:30.588 --> 00:00:37.508
It works from anywhere, even with the cursor in the card search. The arrow keys pick another match, and Escape closes it.

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:42.622
To be found, the project menu in the bar names the shortcut under its list.

00:00:44.806 --> 00:00:49.686
Command P, a few letters, Enter: any project is two seconds away.
